{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created with passion by an indie developer from Korea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy it, that alone will be our greatest joy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946600/extras/6251e5e32daa7f03f69244bfceb284fc.avif?t=1758333001\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Stop the monsters that invaded the Joseon Dynasty and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HGD SURVIVOR is a log-like-based game that survives in a set time and grows by eliminating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play HGD, a character from the Joseon Dynasty, level up, pick a variety of skills to kill your enemies and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Joseon Dynasty, you are the only one who can defeat monsters. Upgrade your skills to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't die. If you die, the Joseon Dynasty will be full of monsters and you'll lose the experience you've built up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports mouse and keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the direction key on the keyboard to manipulate the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold to buy and use items at the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather gold to permanently upgrade various effects on the training page and reset for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tip. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your active skills to the end and you'll get tremendous effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game is difficult, try picking the flowers and mushrooms on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of fearsome attacks by bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you kill three types of bosses, there's something huge.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First_Magician_Defeat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/2af11be4383e32cff6345b33ef31653b7d14b841.jpg"},{"name":"Magician_Slayer ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/b52e1af18f78f2131468b8719e1c7753504e4405.jpg"},{"name":"First_Dragon_Defeat ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/721c9e4c731ea3f0cfa888b5e10e867d52cf0e4a.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon_Slayer ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/c7aa007d26e3d105b668ab1ad078a7535318f7ba.jpg"},{"name":"First_Golem_Defeat ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/69ab6a8d4925498a0d88886176ef9f3973062b62.jpg"},{"name":"Golem_Slayer ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/c1089da3ecc27e51abad2b60c8e50b39881665c8.jpg"},{"name":"First_Witch_Defeat ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/cf271a0f2451c53312fa493a2a251e53add03591.jpg"},{"name":"Witch_Slayer ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/d0768d4c30c23186a165936fb371884aa36d0e76.jpg"},{"name":"1,000_Enemy_Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/38e28ce4ea5b364e6730bac14bf5f517c940eaae.jpg"},{"name":"2,000_Enemy_Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3946600/41684017489d0b7f28044b4349ec207ef6769128.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946600?t=1758333001","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946600?t=1758333001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946600/ec218730a3d63570df731182f1fc07ed1756f0c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758333001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946600/ec218730a3d63570df731182f1fc07ed1756f0c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758333001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created with passion by an indie developer from Korea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy it, that alone will be our greatest joy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946600/extras/6251e5e32daa7f03f69244bfceb284fc.avif?t=1758333001\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Stop the monsters that invaded the Joseon Dynasty and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HGD SURVIVOR is a log-like-based game that survives in a set time and grows by eliminating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play HGD, a character from the Joseon Dynasty, level up, pick a variety of skills to kill your enemies and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Joseon Dynasty, you are the only one who can defeat monsters. Upgrade your skills to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't die. If you die, the Joseon Dynasty will be full of monsters and you'll lose the experience you've built up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports mouse and keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the direction key on the keyboard to manipulate the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold to buy and use items at the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather gold to permanently upgrade various effects on the training page and reset for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tip. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your active skills to the end and you'll get tremendous effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game is difficult, try picking the flowers and mushrooms on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of fearsome attacks by bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you kill three types of bosses, there's something huge.</p>","developers":["Hanseo Cho","Yir Kim"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946600/4815897324386456e7ba3d4de57b86083008ab02/header.jpg?t=1758333001","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946600/430698930/476a83f172292e80a800ac91e9a79314a7ee6f22/1755936613/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757094282","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946600/430698930/476a83f172292e80a800ac91e9a79314a7ee6f22/1755936613/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757094282","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946600/430698930/476a83f172292e80a800ac91e9a79314a7ee6f22/1755936613/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757094282","id":257181655,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181655/movie480.mp4?t=1757094282","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181655/movie_max.mp4?t=1757094282"},"name":"HGD SURVIVOR Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257181655/8d652c8edd2245219b7ef2a2